WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.444
A multilingual website serves
each page in several languages,

2
00:00:05.444 --> 00:00:07.243
each at its own URL.

3
00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:10.645
Pick where translations
live: a proxy,

4
00:00:10.645 --> 00:00:13.583
a CMS plugin, a site builder,

5
00:00:13.583 --> 00:00:16.391
or your code, before
you translate anything.

6
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:20.261
General Translation generates
the translations for sites you

7
00:00:20.261 --> 00:00:21.213
build in code.

8
00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:25.309
Give each language its own URL,

9
00:00:25.309 --> 00:00:27.863
translate titles and
meta descriptions,

10
00:00:27.863 --> 00:00:29.429
and add hreflang.

11
00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:33.926
Offer a language switcher instead of
redirecting visitors automatically.

12
00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:37.506
In code, wrap markup
in the T component,

13
00:00:37.506 --> 00:00:41.325
and run npx gt translate
before the build.

14
00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:44.738
Your team now ships
French with each release.
